#!/usr/bin/env bash
# flow168 (2026-09-09, DRAIN-MIX GENE arm): flow166's gate-aligned recipe with a new theta layout and a held-out gate. NEW BLOCK `gd`/`gbd` (policy.SHAPES, 6,789 -> 7,053; 264 coordinates): one per-product gain on residual_drain's `share` column, decoded LINEARLY as brain.MIX_DRAIN_GAIN * (gh @ gd + gbd) * share, clipped to +-brain.MIX_DRAIN_CLIP, and added to the herd softmax (EGG/MILK/WOOL) and the plant softmax (the five crops) in exactly the place the fixed knobs ANIMAL_MIX_DRAIN_ON / PLANT_MIX_DRAIN_ON add their constant. Zero-init it is exactly 0.0, so this init is byte-for-byte the flow166 init (tests/test_drain_mix_gene.py pins the whole decide+plan digest on 12 seeded boards and 200 recorded states).
# MEASURED SLOPE at the arm's own sigma 0.02, 256 isotropic members x 12 recorded hour-0 boards, scored as 'this member's gene moved its own herd or plant mix': 24.4 % of (member, board) pairs at MIX_DRAIN_GAIN = 5.0 (per-board median 23.8 %). The 15-35 % band is the memory rule a zero-init gene has to clear -- the forward gene shipped at 0.00 % and was invisible to selection.
# GATE = 12 FRESH KAGGLE-LOSS TAPES (NEVER TRAINED); FAMILY IN TRAINING. flow166 read all-games nearly level on its 86 trained gate tapes (-0.4k/game) while the 10 held-out leg-family tapes still fell (-1.9k/game): training moves the boards it trains on, so the held-out set has to be boards nothing has trained on.
# CHANGES vs flow166, exactly seven: (1) --init-theta artifacts/kagg2_games/thetas/flow135_g350_gpfwdfv_gb028_gd.npy (the same champion, zero-padded to 7,053 by scripts/upgrade_theta.py; md5 d1b23026d7788f4f3a5d17caba5e3741); (2) --run flow168; (3) --seed 268; (4) the 10 leg-family tapes move from --rung-weight tape_act_<id>=0 to =2, i.e. INTO training (they were already in --tape-actions); (5) --real-gate-leg-family becomes the 12 fresh Kaggle-loss tapes 107056463,107067869,107068399,107070717,107072760,107079367,107081922,107088554,107090008,107089992,107092814,107095149 -- none of which appears in --tape-actions or in any --rung-weight, so the held-out set is genuinely untrained; (6) their 12 opponent packages artifacts/panel_opp_town/opponent_tape_<id>/main.py join --real-gate-opponent (48 -> 60 opponents, 120 gate games, of which 24 are the held-out 12 at --real-gate-pinned-seats 2); all 12 verified present on the remote 2026-09-09 (ssh user@remote-host 'ls ~/stage_leg20/artifacts/panel_opp_town/', 175 packages, none missing); (7) --best-margin 0.005 -> 0.04. Shaping stays OFF (--abs-weight 0.0 --d10-cash-weight 0 --tile-fill-weight 0), gate every 100, re-centre 3. --train-only stays 'all' -- the new block is 264 of 7,053 coordinates and this is a full-theta continuation; for the cheap gene-only variant pass --train-only gd,gbd instead.
# STAGE: the remote is not a git repo, and this arm is a CODE change -- copy ~/stage_leg20 to ~/stage_draingene (for artifacts/: tape_actions_town, panel_opp_town, town_schedules.json, kagg2_games/thetas), then rsync this worktree's src/ scripts/ tests/ over it, then build the init in place: python scripts/upgrade_theta.py artifacts/kagg2_games/thetas/flow135_g350_gpfwdfv_gb028.npy artifacts/kagg2_games/thetas/flow135_g350_gpfwdfv_gb028_gd.npy (a zero pad, so it must print 6789 -> 7053 and md5 d1b23026d7788f4f3a5d17caba5e3741). A stale tree refuses the 7,053 theta outright ('longer than this build's layout'), which is the failure we want rather than a silent truncation.
# NOTE --abs-select is a SEED-pair selector ('sel'/'hold'/'all'), not a rung selector: there is no flag that restricts the abs probe to named rungs. It does not need one -- AbsReport's headline is a rung-WEIGHTED mean (src/kagg3/es/train.py:1342, wm=np.average(...,weights=w) at :5807), so change (2) already nominates records on the gate's boards and change (2)'s w0 already keeps the family out of the nomination.
# NOTE --episodes 160 against 147 pinned rungs leaves 13 episodes for self-play/pool (flow164 left 54 against 106); --pinned-once will warn. Raise --episodes if the pool matters.
set -euo pipefail
cd ~/stage_draingene
mkdir -p artifacts/flow168
source ~/kagg3/.venv/bin/activate
